OL,3,GNEWSAPotential Great British Railways
OL,4,AHQ plans submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build an eight-storey office
OL,7,Fbuilding on a site shortlisted to
OL,8,Fbecome the headquarters of Great
OL,9,FBritish Railways (GBR) have been
OL,10,Fsubmitted.
OL,12,FDeveloper St James Securities said the
OL,13,F106,544 sq ft (9,898 sq m) building, in
OL,14,Fthe Becketwell area of Derby, could
OL,15,Fsupport up to 1,000 jobs and generate
OL,16,Fup to #100m for the city if GBR chooses
OL,17,Fthe site.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
