OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAPotential Great British Railways
OL,4,AHQ plans submitted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former Duckworth Square site, next
OL,7,Fto Valliant Live entertainment venue,
OL,8,Fand Midland House opposite Derby
OL,9,FRailway Station, are the two contenders
OL,10,Ffor the location of GBR HQ.
OL,12,FSt James Securities said a final
OL,13,Fdecision on GBR HQ's location is
OL,14,F"expected shortly". The Department for
OL,15,FTransport declined to comment.
